\item \strong{Location QC} is computed on the remaining features: minimum total
signal, minimum detected features, lower-tail outliers, the fraction of
signal from excluded features, and an optional mask.
\item \strong{Feature thresholds} are computed on the locations that pass QC,
including the model-aware minimum below.
\item Locations with no remaining signal are removed (\code{drop_empty_locations}).
